Before downloading models — HuggingFace setup:
Accept the Flux.2 Klein license agreement:
🔗 https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8
Create your HuggingFace access token:
🔗 https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens

Models used in this workflow:
Flux.2 Klein 9B FP8 (main diffusion model — requires HuggingFace access token & license agreement):
🔗 https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8
VAE:
🔗 https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors
Text Encoder:
🔗 https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/vae-text-encorder-for-flux-klein-9b/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors
Face Detector (BBOX):
🔗 https://huggingface.co/Bingsu/adetailer/resolve/main/face_yolov8m.pt
SAM Model:
🔗 https://dl.fbaipublicfiles.com/segment_anything/sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth

Key takeaways:

Your LoRA is only as good as the images you train it on
Adjust your prompts, not your settings
Don't filter images mid-generation — run the full batch first
Use multiple angles (high, low, Dutch, front, back) for dataset variety


Do not use real people for your AI character. Use generated or non-real reference images only.